From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 11:01:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 741/743] feat(dsv41): add opt-in VLLM_DS41_LSA BF16 block8
 shortlist indexing

Add opt-in Latent Sparse Attention (VLLM_DS41_LSA=1; default-off 0/unset)
using non-quantized bfloat16 8-key block means (100 bytes/key) accumulated in
float32 via 512-thread cooperative summarize_blocks, QueryReusePlan coarse
scoring, RawWideCoarseTopK (source 1024), DirectCoarseTopK (source_short 512),
prefill_short (dense 64 at 32K), and unified score_width routing across 32K-1M
prefill and multi-row decode.

Upstream-base: 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
Quality: default-off path is 100% unchanged native indexing (68-byte keys);
opt-in path preserves full BF16 block means and FP32 accumulation without
downward quantization.
Tests: 7 GPU correctness and sanitizer gates (initcheck, racecheck, timing,
registration, actual 12-batch recall, 72/72 CUDA graph routes) and 2-boot
32K-1M benchmark matrix.
